Basing this off of version 1.13.1 to be compatible with the version of Spark I'm
working with. That requires Thrift version 0.16.0, which is no longer in default
Homebrew tap. Used this git repo for that

https://github.com/cartman-kai/homebrew-thrift

via 
```
brew tap cartman-kai/thrift
brew install thrift@0.16
```

For mac. For Linux, follow instructions on main README for thrift installation.

Compiled the Parquet-Hadoop library this way to enable reflection despite
running on Java 17--possibly a hack, but working for now
```
MAVEN_OPTS="--add-opens java.base/java.lang=ALL-UNNAMED" mvn clean install -pl parquet-hadoop -DskipTests
```
